{"id":"wb-6-586","name":"西陂天后宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西陂天后宫","text":"西陂天后宫位于福建永定区高陂乡西陂村，主祀妈祖女神。2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n西陂天后宫始建于明嘉靖二十一年（1542年），落成于清康熙元年（1662年）。西陂村民多为林姓，因乡民渡海移民往东南亚等地，因此修建天后宫祈求妈祖保佑。\n\n西陂天后宫由大门、戏台、大宝殿和登云馆组成，占地6435平方米。主体建筑为7层塔式结构，通高40余米，俗称“文塔”。底层为主殿，供奉主神天后，二至五层，分祀关帝、文昌帝君、魁星和仓颉。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E9%99%82%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%E5%AE%AB","revisionId":86565307,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86565307","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f92e15cedba35007b6a958f6.jpg","title":"Yongding_Xibei_Tianhou_Gong_2013.10.05_11-11-35.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yongding_Xibei_Tianhou_Gong_2013.10.05_11-11-35.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/Yongding_Xibei_Tianhou_Gong_2013.10.05_11-11-35.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"福建省永定县西陂天后宫","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}